  <metadata>
    <name>Baltā vilka ceļš mājup</name>
    <desc>Established literary walking route from Smārde railway station to Jānis Baltvilks’s birthplace Zīlītes. Official Tukums tourism map coordinates, retrieved 2026-09-05, preserved without interpolation. Mainly roads and village lanes; one way. Do not enter the buildings at Zīlītes. Route authors: Baltā vilka takas and Tukuma Literātu apvienība.</desc>
    <link href="https://www.visittukums.lv/lv/Marsruti/Pargajienu-marsruti/Balta-Vilka-cels-majup" />
  </metadata>
